   "top": 2046.5,
   "left": 592.5,
   "w": 302.8,
   "h": 217,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "Our team aimed to bring the theme Form Follows Feeling to life through an engaging and cohesive event experience for World Industrial Design Week 2026. The challenge was to ",
     "size": 18.4,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "translate an abstract concept into a clear visual identity",
     "size": 18.4,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " and supporting materials that communicated the event’s message while maintaining consistency across its various activities and touchpoints.\n",
     "size": 18.4,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "LBvT7BBgZyQy42Bm",
   "type": "text",
   "top": 2046.5,
   "left": 940.9,
   "w": 325.8,
   "h": 207.2,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "As Creative Lead and Publications Head, I helped guide the event’s ",
     "size": 18.9,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "visual direction and oversee the development of its publication materials and graphic assets. ",
     "size": 18.9,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "My role involved translating the event’s concept into visual communications, ensuring consistency across designs, and collaborating with the team to create materials that reflected the event’s identity and purpose.\n",
     "size": 18.9,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
  },
