   "top": 2858.4,
   "left": 706.4,
   "w": 623,
   "h": 99.2,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "As Creative Lead and Publications Head, I guided our visual direction, coordinated publication deliverables, and worked alongside ",
     "size": 16.3,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "a team whose collective strengths carried the project beyond what I could achieve alone.",
     "size": 16.3,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " This experience taught me that leadership is not about doing everything myself, but about empowering others to contribute their best. It became a defining reminder of my design philosophy:",
     "size": 16.3,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " to design is to serve.\n",
     "size": 16.3,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3",
     "deco": "underline"
    }
   ]
  },
