   "id": "LBYZxHwtd36t3r6H",
   "type": "text",
   "top": 7922.7,
   "left": 77.1,
   "w": 497,
   "h": 122.5,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "This experience was more than a unified visual identity for World Industrial Design Week 2026. The photos and documented process barely capture how much my Publications team lifted me up where I fell short, filling the gaps through their dedication, support, and shared effort. This experience reminded me that",
     "size": 15.2,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#242424",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " design is never a solitary act,",
     "size": 15.2,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#242424",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " but a collective effort built on trust and a willingness to serve one another. It further strengthened my belief that",
     "size": 15.2,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#242424",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " to design is to serve.",
     "size": 15.2,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#242424",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "\n",
     "size": 15.2,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#242424",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
